                <ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF UUID="ECUC:154a283d-82e3-45cd-a7a1-f3264adee18b">
                  <SHORT-NAME>EcucPostBuildVariants</SHORT-NAME>
                  <DESC>
                    <L-2 L="EN">Collection of toplevel PostBuildSelectable variants. The PredefinedVariants linked inside this container will determine how many PostBuildSelectableVariants exist. If this container exist the name pattern for initialization of BSW modules will be &lt;Mip&gt;_Config_&lt;PredefinedVariant.shortName&gt;. If this container does not exist the name pattern for initialization of BSW modlues will be &lt;Mip&gt;_Config.</L-2>
                    <L-2 L="ZH">概述：EcucPostBuildVariants用于定义ECU配置的后期构建变体，允许在不重新编译的情况下通过不同的配置变体来调整ECU的行为，以适应不同的应用场景和需求。</L-2>
                    <L-2 L="ZH">注意：确保每个变体的配置数据完整且一致，以避免运行时错误；变体的选择应在系统初始化时进行，并且不能在运行时动态更改；在配置工具中正确设置和管理变体，以确保生成的配置数据符合系统需求。</L-2>
                  </DESC>
                  <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_EcuC_00070</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                  <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                  <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                  <REFERENCES>
                    <ECUC-FOREIGN-REFERENCE-DEF UUID="ECUC:6e75f9c8-e66b-4ca6-8d0b-c14951c14811">
                      <SHORT-NAME>EcucPostBuildVariantRef</SHORT-NAME>
                      <DESC>
                        <L-2 L="EN">Reference to a PredefinedVariant that defines one toplevel postBuild configuration set (covering all post-build capable BSW modules). PredefinedVariants that are referenced here shall contain only PostBuildVariantCriterionValueSets.</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">概述：EcucPostBuildVariantRef用于引用ECU配置的后期构建变体，允许在系统构建后选择不同的配置变体以适应不同的运行环境或需求。</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">注意：确保引用的变体在构建后可用且有效；变体选择应与系统需求和运行环境相匹配；变体的管理和选择应遵循项目的版本控制和配置管理策略。</L-2>
                      </DESC>
                      <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_EcuC_00071</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                      <!-- TODO The EcucPostBuildVariantRef is not used and set to non-essential configuration items. -->
                      <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY-INFINITE>true</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY-INFINITE>
                      <MULTIPLICITY-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                        <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                        </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                        <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                        </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                      </MULTIPLICITY-CONFIG-CLASSES>
