                <ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF UUID="ECUC:2b261d84-fed7-4fd0-b94b-2cac2e4fb5fe">
                  <SHORT-NAME>EcucUnitGroupAssignment</SHORT-NAME>
                  <DESC>
                    <L-2 L="EN">Collection of UnitGroup references to support the generation of ASAM MCD file.</L-2>
                    <L-2 L="ZH">概述：EcucUnitGroupAssignment用于将ECU配置单元（EcucUnit）分配到特定的组中，以便进行模块化管理和配置，确保系统的灵活性和可维护性。</L-2>
                    <L-2 L="ZH">注意：确保每个EcucUnit仅分配到一个组中以避免配置冲突；合理设计组结构以便于管理和更新；在配置工具中进行分配时，注意保持一致性和完整性。</L-2>
                  </DESC>
                  <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_EcuC_00063</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                  <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                  <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                  <REFERENCES>
                    <ECUC-FOREIGN-REFERENCE-DEF UUID="ECUC:bdb68486-b9c6-47e4-baac-ff65e646115f">
                      <SHORT-NAME>EcucUnitGroupRef</SHORT-NAME>
                      <DESC>
                        <L-2 L="EN">Optional reference to the UnitGroup to support the generation of ASAM MCD file. These UnitGroups are selecting a set of  units for a specific country.</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">概述：EcucUnitGroupRef用于引用一个或多个Ecuc模块配置单元组，以便在配置过程中对这些单元组进行统一管理和操作。它帮助实现模块配置的组织和分组，简化配置管理。</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">注意：确保引用的Ecuc模块配置单元组在系统中已定义；引用的单元组应具有一致的配置目标和用途；避免循环引用以防止配置冲突和复杂性增加。</L-2>
                      </DESC>
                      <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_EcuC_00062</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                      <!-- TODO The EcucUnitGroupRef is not used and set to non-essential configuration items. -->
                      <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY-INFINITE>true</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY-INFINITE>
                      <MULTIPLICITY-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                        <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
